  "reference_solution": "def clamp_value(value, low, high):\n    if value < low:\n        return low\n    elif value > high:\n        return high\n    else:\n        return value\n\nvalue = int(input())\nlow = int(input())\nhigh = int(input())\nprint(clamp_value(value, low, high))\n",
  "solution_explanation": "函数只根据参数比较读数与上下界，并在对应分支返回整数。读数等于上下界时原样返回；当 low 与 high 相同时，任何读数都会修正为同一个值。输入与打印由主程序负责。",
